// 3.    $T_{\mathrm{iter}} = T \cdot (0.5 + (\mathrm{iter}/(I-1))\cdot 1.5)$  // 0.5T → 2T
// 4.    Generate AR(1) colored noise: $\eta_t = 0.25\eta_{t-1} + 0.75 \xi_t$, $\xi_t \sim \mathcal{N}$
// 5.    Sample $a_t \leftarrow \mu + \sigma\,\eta_t$; insert kept elites + π warm-starts
// 6.    Score elites; $s_{\mathrm{soft}} = \mathrm{softmax}(T_{\mathrm{iter}}\,V_{\mathrm{elite}})$, $s_{\mathrm{rank}}\propto 1/(1+\mathrm{rank})$
// 7.    $s = 0.8\,s_{\mathrm{soft}} + 0.2\,s_{\mathrm{rank}}$
// 8.    $\mu_{\mathrm{new}}, \sigma_{\mathrm{new}} \leftarrow$ weighted mean/std of elites by $s$
// 9.    $\mu \leftarrow 0.15\,\mu + 0.85\,\mu_{\mathrm{new}}$ (no momentum on iter 0); kept ← top-n_keep elites
// 10. Final action: Gumbel sample over $s$; add $\sigma_0$ noise unless eval_mode

